chapter.v:
	And whereas 

	 you are being sent by the king and his seven counselors to inquire concerning Judah and Jerusalem, with regard to the Law of your God which is in your hand;
 [2 Kin. 23:26; 2 Chr. 28:11-13;]

	and whereas 

	 you are to carry the silver and gold which the king and his counselors have freely offered to the God of Israel, whose dwelling is in Jerusalem;
 [Ezra 8:16; Neh. 3:4]
